{"synopsis":"Lee Hanrok, seorang pegawai marketing yang jenius dari divisi bisnis film! Dia mendadak dibenci semua orang karena mendapat penilaian terendah dalam evaluasi karyawan. Tak hanya sampai di situ, dia bahkan difitnah menerima suap sampai akhirnya didepak dari perusahaan. Namun, Hanrok tiba-tiba kembali ke lima tahun lalu saat segalanya mulai berantakan. Kini, dia tak mau jadi korban lagi dan mulai melangkahi batas! Tebak apa yang bakal terjadi?","alternative_title":"천재 회사원이 선넘으면 생기는일","author":"도루묵, 오십이","artist":"도루묵, 오십이","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"eb630618-a23e-4d33-8afa-1b0251b0e794","number":"53","chapter":"53","title":"","date":"2026-07-30","released":"2026-07-30","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_475d7ac6-38a7-4e6a-896d-dd05222ab071/chapter_ch_53/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_475d7ac6-38a7-4e6a-896d-dd05222ab071/chapter_ch_53/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_475d7ac6-38a7-4e6a-896d-dd05222ab071/chapter_ch_53/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_475d7ac6-38a7-4e6a-896d-dd05222ab071/chapter_ch_53/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_475d7ac6-38a7-4e6a-896d-dd05222ab071/chapter_ch_53/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_475d7ac6-38a7-4e6a-896d-dd05222ab071/chapter_ch_53/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_475d7ac6-38a7-4e6a-896d-dd05222ab071/chapter_ch_53/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_475d7ac6-38a7-4e6a-896d-dd05222ab071/chapter_ch_53/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_475d7ac6-38a7-4e6a-896d-dd05222ab071/chapter_ch_53/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_475d7ac6-38a7-4e6a-896d-dd05222ab071/chapter_ch_53/10.webp"]},{"chapter_id":"1492d7ee-cbde-4097-b67e-1c599f375838","number":"52","chapter":"52","title":"","date":"2026-07-30","released":"2026-07-30","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_475d7ac6-38a7-4e6a-896d-dd05222ab071/chapter_ch_52/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_475d7ac6-38a7-4e6a-896d-dd05222ab0